          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme Muambi nakadi mukelenge wa Isalele mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakateka mutshima wanyi ne meji anyi mu kukeba ne mu kujingulula kua malu onso adi menjibue muinshi mua diulu; eu mmudimu wa lutatu wakuha Nzambi ba ha buloba bua kubadisha nʼau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatangila malu onso adi menjibue muinshi mua diba; monai, malu au onso adi hatuhu, adi bu kuihata kua luhehele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
